				{ title = "The Tower of Althalaxx", tip = "East of Buzzbox 323, Balthule Shadowstrike hides at the foot of the tower among the Dark Strand Fanatics. Keep his letter for Delgren in Ashenvale.\nCareful: Dark Strand Voidcallers (28-29) with their voidwalkers and Athrikus Narassin (31) stand in the tower itself: take the parchments from the Fanatics south of it and keep away from the tower.", zone = 1439, goals = {
