				{ title = "The Master's Glaive", tip = "Moonstalker Sires prowl the woods around the glaive. The Twilight Tome sits at the bottom of the crater; Therylune stands on its north side. For Onu's quest, use the Phial of Scrying at the bottom of the crater: it makes the Scrying Bowl, and you hand the quest in to the bowl.", zone = 1439, goals = {
