				{ title = "Tranquil Gardens Cemetery: kill these as you meet them", tip = "Skeletal Warriors and Skeletal Mages walk among the graves south-east of Darkshire, below Blind Mary's house on the hill. Every skeleton in Duskwood can drop a Skeleton Finger.\nCareful: Because the skeletons stand near each other, running straight in tends to pull several at once.", zone = 1431, goals = {
