				{ title = "Raven Hill Cemetery: kill these as you meet them", tip = "The cemetery lies north of the village. Skeletal Horrors and Skeletal Fiends walk its southern half. Mor'Ladim, an elite, wanders the graves: keep away from him.", zone = 1431, goals = {
