				{ title = "Lakeshire", tip = "Cross the long bridge north into town: Dockmaster Baren on the docks, Bailiff Conacher in the town hall, Martie Jainrose in her garden at the west end. Marshal Marris's Blackrock quests and Alther's Mill came with you from your first Redridge visit.", zone = 1433, goals = {
