				{ title = "Nightbane Vile Fangs and the Insane Ghoul", tip = "The strongest worgen roam the woods south of Darkshire, west and south of the Tranquil Gardens Cemetery. The Insane Ghoul hides in the small crypt by the cemetery.\nCareful: Curse of Blood lasts 10 minutes and adds 13 to each hit of physical damage you take.\nCareful: Some worgen outside the cave stand in groups, including one camp of four. To avoid adds, pull them one at a time from the raised ground next to the cave entrance.", zone = 1431, goals = {
