				} },
				{ title = "Dragonmaw Gates: kill these as you meet them", tip = "The whelps nest in the hills north-east of the Angerfang Encampment; Carnage prowls further north, and the Razormaw raptors hunt the highlands on the way north to Dun Modr.\nCarnage is elite: grouping up is advised.", zone = 1437, goals = {
