				{ title = "The Drowned Reef: kill these as you meet them", tip = "The two wrecks lie in the bay west of the cove. The charts and logs are inside them; the gems lie on the sea floor around them. Daggerspine naga swim the whole bay.", zone = 1417, goals = {
