				{ title = "Melizza Brimbuzzle", tip = "Melizza is held in the centaur camp west of the graveyard. Free her and keep her alive on the walk out; she stops by the graveyard.\nCareful: The scripted groups are linked and only appear during the escort, so you cannot clear them in advance or pull them one at a time. Clearing the normal centaurs on the path before you start does help.", zone = 1443, goals = {
