				{ title = "Sar'theris Strand: kill these as you meet them", tip = "The Slitherblade naga hold the north-west coast north of Azore's tower; Karnitol's satchel lies on the sea floor off it, and any naga can drop Rackmore's golden key. Swim out to Ranazjar Isle off the far northern tip and use the Gem of the Serpent on the Serpent Statue: Lord Kragaru (38) rises; kill him for the Book of the Ancients.", zone = 1443, goals = {
