				{ title = "Cortello's scroll", tip = "Optional: Cortello's scroll lies inside one of the three Bloodsail ships anchored off the coast just south of Booty Bay, on a middle or lower deck, and is not always on the same ship. Their crews are 42-45 pirates: clear your way from the edge, one at a time, and leave the captains (45-48), whom the route comes back for at 48.", zone = 1434, goals = {
