				{ title = "Lost Rigger Cove: kill these as you meet them", tip = "Follow the coast south to the pirate cove. Southsea pirates crowd the beach and the boats: work along the edge and pull one at a time. Andre Firebeard stands on the far side; Stoley's stolen cargo lies in the camp.\nCareful: Two or three pirates stand with Andre, and many more pirates from the town join the fight once it starts.", zone = 1446, goals = {
