				{ title = "The Tome of Divinity", tip = "West from the Forlorn Cavern into the Mystic Ward: Brandur Ironhammer, Tiza Battleforge and Muiredon Battleforge are in the Hall of Mysteries, Tiza and Muiredon on its upper floor: the stairs up start just north-east of Brandur. John Turner, a beggar, wanders the city. He asks for ten Linen Cloth: the troggs and trolls of Dun Morogh drop it, and the Auction House sells it.", only = { classes = { "Paladin" } }, zone = 1455, goals = {
