				{ title = "Darnassus", tip = "Follow the road west into Darnassus and use the Lunar Pendant at the inn on the Craftsmen's Terrace and at the tunnel mouth below Cenarion Hold for the last two owls. Mydrannul stands on the Craftsmen's Terrace just inside the city. Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm is in the Cenarion Enclave at the north end of the city, Rellian Greenspyre just south of it; Lariia, Tyrande Whisperwind, Priestess A'moora and Sentinel Dalia Sunblade are in the Temple of the Moon at the south end.", zone = 1457, goals = {
