				{ title = "The relics of the Barrow Dens", tip = "The Great Cat Spirit (Night Elves) waits on the hill above the bridge in southern Moonglade; the Avatar of Saeyleenan (Skyborne) stands on high ground past the twin bridges, south-west of Nighthaven: climb up to it. The relics lie in the Stormrage Barrow Dens east of the lake: leave your form and click the statue at the den's entrance for a short stealth (five minutes), then go deep into the cave and over the bridge. Enraged spirits guard the relics and attack anything they see: stay in the statue's stealth and keep moving. Each relic is a small orb beside a cat statue in an alcove: the Fang and the Claw have one spot each, the Silent Shadow two, and it is the one players camp. A relic shows as unusable while another player loots it: wait a moment and try again. Stealth gone? Walk back to the entrance statue for more.", only = { races = { "NightElf", "Skyborne" }, factions = { "Alliance" } }, zone = 1450, goals = {
