				{ title = "Lessons Anew", tip = "Mathrengyl Bearwalker stands upstairs in the druids' building of the Cenarion Enclave; Alfina Nightgaze by the Skyborne Portal does not give this quest. Cast Teleport: Moonglade and take Silva Fil'naveth's flight from the middle of Nighthaven (she flies druids to Rut'theran Village, no flight path needed), then the portal up. No Herbalism? Buy five Earthroot on the Auction House first: you need them later.", only = { races = { "Skyborne" }, factions = { "Alliance" } }, zone = 1457, goals = {
