				{ title = "Rods of Channeling", tip = "The Dragonmaw hold Angerfang Encampment in the hills east of the road through the Wetlands, south of the Thandol Span you cross from Arathi Highlands. Only the casters drop the rods, four kills in five: the Bonewarders (level 27, with skeleton pets) and Shadowwarders (28). A steep path north of the central spirit healer leads up into the camp past most of the warriors.", zone = 1437, goals = {
