				{ title = "WRIGGLE.", tip = "Find an Excitable Slime, a little critter in the canal water beside Boyle, target it and /dance at it, again and again, until it dances back and offers WRIGGLE.; this takes many tries. Hand in the sludge right away. If the slime seems tired, /dance with it again before you hand in.", zone = 1458, goals = {
