					{ kind = "goto", label = "Skyboat to Zephras Isle", map = 1412, x = 34.3, y = 25.8, frame = "live" },
				} },
				{ title = "Revered with the Nightclaw Druids", tip = "Vayn Moongaze, the druids' quartermaster, waits inside their den in the Shadowgale Forest, the cave just north-east of Elegael Thornpaw's camp. He sells the squirrel (50s) once you are Revered with the Nightclaw Druids. Get there young: the Shadowgale storyline and Vayn's first ear quest take you to Friendly, and his repeatable pays 1000 for five Al'Aketh Cultist's Ears up to level 18 but, by Classic's rules, only 200 from level 22. From Friendly to Revered that is about 80 ears at level 18 and about 400 at 22 or above. The Nightclaw Druids Reputation guide walks you through it.", zone = 2521, goals = {
