				{ title = "Lower Blackrock Spire", tip = "Lower Blackrock Spire is a group of five, level 55-60, inside Blackrock Mountain. The Spire Spider Eggs lie around Mother Smolderweb's nest in the Skitterweb Tunnels, the spider halls: click them until you have 15 (each gives one to three). Hard-hitting spiderlings can hatch as you loot. By player reports the eggs cannot be looted in a raid group, so keep the party at five or fewer.", zone = 1428, goals = {
