				{ title = "Tear of the Moons", tip = "On the road south to the Great Lift, turn east into the Bael Modan dig. Feegly the Exiled hides at its south edge. General Twinbraid's Strongbox stands on the bottom floor of the dwarves' fortress, beside General Twinbraid (30) and his Officers (26): pull them to you one at a time.", zone = 1413, goals = {
