				{ title = "Hammerfall", tip = "The orc stronghold at the eastern end of the road. Urda, the wind rider master, stands by the gate.\nRutherford Twing offers the Defiler's Basic Care Package only once you are Friendly with the Defilers (Arathi Basin): skip it if he doesn't offer it.", zone = 1417, goals = {
