				{ title = "Nesingwary's camp", tip = "Follow the road north out of Grom'gol; Nesingwary's hunting camp sits on the hill north-east of the river. Krazek wants it investigated: walk among its tents. From here on, keep every page of The Green Hills of Stranglethorn you loot: Barnil takes them on your next Stranglethorn visit.", zone = 1434, goals = {
