				{ title = "Nesingwary's Expedition: kill these as you meet them", tip = "River Crocolisks lie along the river below the camp. Young Stranglethorn Tigers prowl west of the camp, Young Panthers east of it. Head west past the camp. Stranglethorn Raptors (33-34) hunt the clearings, and the Bloodscalp trolls hold the ruins on the coast: every Bloodscalp can drop a tusk. A Pendant of Myzrael is a very rare drop from them: if one drops, read it. Careful: The troll camps have many patrolling mobs, so other trolls often join a fight.", zone = 1434, goals = {
					{ kind = "collect", quest = 575, item = 4053 },
