				{ title = "Stranglethorn Vale: kill these as you meet them", tip = "Stranglethorn Tigers (32) roam the hills around the camp and south of it, Panthers (32) the clearings west and south-west of it. The Venture Co. Geologists, who carry the Tumbled Crystals, work the camps by Lake Nazferiti, south-east of the camp.", zone = 1434, goals = {
