				{ title = "The Savage Coast: kill these as you meet them", tip = "West past the camp, Crystal Spine Basilisks (34-35) sit on the rocks; every Bloodscalp in the village beyond can drop an ear.\nSin'Dall, a level 37 tiger, prowls the hilltop south-west of the camp.\nCareful: The raptor nest has young raptors that join the fight when you attack the adults.", zone = 1434, goals = {
