				{ title = "Stranglethorn Vale: kill these as you meet them", tip = "East of the Mosh'Ogg hills, Shadowmaw Panthers (37-38) stalk the jungle towards the lake; the Stranglethorn Tigresses roam the same ground and now and then drop a pristine fang. Snapjaw Crocolisks line the river just west of the jungle; keep their skins for Drizzlik. Careful: Shadowmaw Panthers (level 37-38) and Elder Shadowmaw Panthers (level 42-43) use Sneak while out of combat, so they remain hidden until you get near them.", zone = 1434, goals = {
