				{ title = "Brackenwall Village: kill these as you meet them", tip = "Head west back across the marsh. The Darkfang Venomspitters on the ridges north of Brackenwall drop the venom sacs. Theramore Infiltrators (35-36) sneak through the same woods: they are stealthed, so look closely.\nThe Darkmist spiders swarm the cavern mouth north-west of Brackenwall; every kind drops eyes.\nCareful: Darkfang Lurkers (level 36-37) use Sneak to stealth while out of combat and cast Poison once fighting.\nCareful: Stealthed spiders in the same area will attack you on sight.\nCareful: Darkmist Lurkers move about stealthed and use poison once in combat. The spiders stand close together, so adds are common; pulling single targets from the outer edge cuts down on them.", zone = 1445, goals = {
