				{ title = "The Drowned Reef: kill these as you meet them", tip = "West of the cove the Daggerspine Raiders and Sorceresses (38-40) hold the shore: pull them one at a time. The two wrecks lie in the shallows off it, the charts and logs inside them; the gems lie on the sea floor around the wrecks.", zone = 1417, goals = {
