				{ title = "Zul'Kunda", tip = "West of the expedition, the Bloodscalp chiefs Gan'zulah and Nezzliok stand together in the ruins of Zul'Kunda. Clear their guards first, then pull them. Stay on the Bloodscalps here until level 41: Speaking with Gan'zulah, at the cauldron next, sends you to Skullsplitters of 41-43. Or, with a group, run the Uldaman dungeon instead.\nOn the coast between Zul'Kunda and Grom'gol an Elder Saltwater Crocolisk (level 38 elite) shares the spawns of the ordinary crocolisks: kill it if it is up and take its skin for Drizzlik.", zone = 1434, goals = {
