				{ title = "Waterspring Field: kill these as you meet them", tip = "The shadow mages, rogues and assassins camp south-east of Gadgetzan.\nSouth-east of Gadgetzan the Wastewander bandits camp in the dunes; Caliph stands in the eastern camp.\nCareful: Wastewander Rogues keep Sneak up while out of combat, so hidden rogues can join a fight you start at a camp.\nCareful: Two stealthed Wastewander Rogues travel with him wherever he goes. At his spawn camp, two shadowmages and their minions are close enough to join a fight with him. Out by the towers you can fight him without them.", zone = 1446, goals = {
