				} },
				{ title = "Homing Robot OOX-22/FE", tip = "Only with the distress beacon: any beast, gnoll or ogre in Feralas can drop it, about one kill in a hundred; use it to start the quest. The robot sits in a small cave on the north side of Feral Scar Vale, just north-west of the ruins. Escort it to the dock on the Forgotten Coast; yetis and gorillas ambush you on the way. Its reward waits in Booty Bay for a later visit.\nCareful: Three ambushes spawn during the escort, and the robot warns you before each one. The first is 3 yetis, just after the robot leaves the cave and climbs toward the road. The second is 3 gorillas, on the path that runs along the cliff. The third is about 4 gnolls, one of them a caster, where the route turns off toward the dock.", zone = 1444, goals = {
