				{ title = "OOX-17/TN", tip = "Only with the distress beacon: OOX-17/TN sits south-east of Scrimshank's hive. Escort it north to Steamwheedle Port; its reward waits with Oglethorpe in Booty Bay.\nCareful: The escort has two ambushes. Three level 47 scorpids attack near the start. Near the end, by the beach, three Wastewander humans attack: one mage and two assassins, around level 44.", zone = 1446, goals = {
