				} },
				{ title = "Searing Gorge: kill these as you meet them", tip = "Heavy War Golems patrol the Cauldron below Velarok and drop the oil; the Magma and Blazing Elementals drifting among them drop the hearts. The Dark Iron Taskmasters and Slavers drive the slaves on the paths; a Slaver may drop the Grimesilt Outhouse Key: keep it.\nThe Greater Lava Spiders roam the plateaus and lava pools in the south-west of the gorge.\nThe Slag Pit opens in the north of the Cauldron. Incendosaurs swim in its lava pools: pull them to the edge. The secret plans lie on the pit's upper ledge.\nCareful: Dark Iron Slavers (level 45-46) call for help from allies within 15 yd when pulled, cast Net from up to 15 yd, and use Rend in melee.", zone = 1427, goals = {
					{ kind = "collect", item = 11818, optional = true, note = "Grimesilt Outhouse Key, a rare drop" },
					{ kind = "collect", quest = 3442, objective = 1, item = 10509 },
