					{ kind = "interact", quest = 4287, objective = 1, object = 164957 },
				} },
				{ title = "The Marshlands", tip = "Careful: There are many ravasaurs roaming the area, so you can easily pull several at the same time.\nBelow level 52, keep hunting the ravasaurs here after the eighth claw: The Rise of the Machines at Kargath needs level 52, and the Plaguelands quests at the end of this guide are level 55. Or, with a group, run the Sunken Temple dungeon or the Maraudon dungeon instead.", zone = 1449, goals = {
