				{ title = "Tirisfal Glades: kill these as you meet them", tip = "Greater Duskbats fly over the fields around Brill and along the road north: Gretchen wants their pelts, Shelene their wings.\nThe Doom Weed grows in the graveyard fields just north of Brill, where the Rot Hide Graverobbers dig; all the Rot Hides drop the ichor.\nThe Rot Hide Mongrels hold the hills further north. Maggot Eye (level 11) stands in their camp on the hill south of the shore: clear the gnolls around him first.\nCareful: Gnoll guards stand outside the hut and can join the fight. If you slip past them and fight him inside, he fights alone.\nThe Vile Fin murlocs line the north shore: they all drop the scales, and the Minor Oracles and Muckdwellers the skins for Shelene.", zone = 1420, goals = {
