				{ title = "Raids: Onyxia", tip = "Killing Onyxia is a point. Onyxia's Lair is a 40-player raid in Dustwallow Marsh, open from 9 December. Every raider needs the Drakefire Amulet in the bags: the Alliance chain starts with Dragonkin Menace in the Burning Steppes, the Horde chain with Blood and Thunder in Kargath (Badlands); both end in Upper Blackrock Spire with General Drakkisath.", zone = 1454, goals = {
