				} },
				{ title = "Level 60 books: Eastern Plaguelands", tip = "A Study of the Light is inside Light's Hope Chapel. The Knight and the Lady lies at Corin's Crossing; other copies lie elsewhere in the zone (one by the Stratholme gates), and you can take only one. Scourge: Undead Menace or Misunderstood? is on a table in Plaguewood: wait for the patrolling elite to clear the creatures beside it and walk on.", zone = 1423, goals = {
