				{ title = "Journeyman Alchemy", tip = "Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 4s 50c (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Alchemy 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every Alchemy trainer teaches it: Alliance Alchemist Narett (Dustwallow Marsh), Jaxin Chong (Stranglethorn Vale), Kylanna (Ashenvale), Lilyssia Nightbreeze (Stormwind City), Sylvanna Forestmoon (Darnassus) and Tally Berryfizz (Ironforge); Horde Bena Winterhoof (Thunder Bluff), Doctor Marsh (Undercity), Jaxin Chong (Stranglethorn Vale), Serge Hinott (Hillsbrad Foothills) and Yelmak (Orgrimmar). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: Minor Mana Potion (from 25, 1s). Also learn Mana Well (1s): Forever's Alchemy camp item, 1 Peacebloom and 1 Empty Vial, placed at a campsite beside a campfire for its buff. The Camping 101: Alchemy quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to an alchemy trainer who teaches it free. 75-150 takes about 1s of recipes and 9s 8c of vendor goods, plus 77 Mageroyal, 152 Briarthorn and 54 Bruiseweed to gather or buy.", section = { title = "Alchemy 75-150", min = 75, max = 150, profession = "Alchemy" }, zone = 947, goals = {
