				{ title = "Expert Alchemy", tip = "Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225 for 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Alchemy 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance Ainethil (Darnassus); Horde Doctor Herbert Halsey (Undercity). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. 150-225 takes about 33s 20c of vendor goods, plus 40 Wild Steelbloom, 39 Kingsblood, 39 Stranglekelp and 40 Goldthorn to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach Mana Potion (from 160) and Elixir of Defense (from 195), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 3.", section = { title = "Alchemy 150-225", min = 150, max = 225, profession = "Alchemy" }, zone = 947, goals = {
