				{ title = "Crafted Heavy Shot to 94", tip = "Crafted Heavy Shot is orange at 75 (yellow 85, green 90, grey 95): about 15 crafts to 94. Each takes 1 Coarse Blasting Powder and 1 Copper Bar and makes 200. Make the 15 Coarse Blasting Powder first: it gives points too while not grey. The Coarse Blasting Powder in each gives its own point while it is not grey: two chances a craft. Sell the shot to hunters or a vendor. Copper Bar (72 for 75-150): Mining: smelt Copper Ore; or the Auction House.", section = { title = "Engineering 75-150", min = 75, max = 150, profession = "Engineering" }, zone = 947, goals = {
