				{ title = "Fishing: Stranglethorn Vale (225-300)", tip = "Fish the pools along the coast here (eels, snappers, wreckage) until skill 300, about 650 catches (one in seven raises the skill at 225, one in ten by 300). Harder water levels no faster: a catch counts the same anywhere. From skill 225 this water loses no fish, so no lure is needed. The Aquadynamic Fish Attractor (+100 from skill 100, 2s 50c) and Bright Baubles are for harder water and rare fish, not for skill.", section = { title = "Fishing 225-300", min = 225, max = 300, profession = "Fishing" }, zone = 1434, goals = {
