				{ title = "Nimble Leather Gloves to 125", tip = "Nimble Leather Gloves is orange at 102 (yellow 120, green 132, grey 145): about 24 crafts to 125. Each takes 1 Elixir of Minor Agility, 6 Medium Leather and 1 Fine Thread. Each takes an Elixir of Minor Agility: an alchemist makes it from a Swiftthistle and a Silverleaf, and the Auction House has it cheap. With no elixirs, take Fine Leather Belt on to 105 and Dark Leather Cloak (from 85: 8 Medium Leather, a Gray Dye and a Fine Thread) to 125: about 28 cloaks, 224 Medium Leather in all. Elixir of Minor Agility (24 for 75-150): Alchemy: Elixir of Minor Agility; or the Auction House.", section = { title = "Leatherworking 75-150", min = 75, max = 150, profession = "Leatherworking" }, zone = 947, goals = {
