				{ title = "Artisan Leatherworking", tip = "Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300; it needs Leatherworking 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance Drakk Stonehand (The Hinterlands); Horde Hahrana Ironhide (Feralas). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: Rugged Armor Kit (from 225). 225-300 takes about 3g 40s of recipes and 44g 90s of vendor goods, plus 1029 Rugged Leather and 430 Runecloth to gather or buy.", section = { title = "Leatherworking 225-300", min = 225, max = 300, profession = "Leatherworking" }, zone = 947, goals = {
