				{ title = "Signets and scepters to Exalted", tip = "Revered to Exalted is 21,000 reputation: 210 text turn-ins (2,100 texts), or less with the rest. From Honored, Bor takes 3 Abyssal Signets for 100 (each Duke also gives 25, to Exalted), and Aurel takes one Abyssal Scepter for A Humble Offering (200, once). From Revered, Goldleaf's Discovery leads to Lords of the Council: 3 signets and 5 Large Brilliant Shards buy the Ring of Lordship, and set, medallion and ring open the Greater Wind Stone for an Abyssal Lord: a level 63 boss for a raid of about 20, 50 reputation, and an Abyssal Scepter. Bor pays 200 for the first scepter and 150 for each 3 after. Revered opens Mishta's Satchel of Cenarius (5g), Gaea's Embrace (9g) and Sylvan Vest (5g); Exalted is the standing for Champion's Battlegear at Vargus.", zone = 1451, goals = {
