				} },
				{ title = "Magram: totems and kills to Honored", tip = "Friendly to Honored is 6,000; after the clan's quests you are about 3,000 into it (4,000 with Gizmo for Warug), so 2,000 to 3,000 to go. Gorhak's Economic Warfare takes 5 Carved Centaur Totems for 750, again and again; the Maraudine centaurs (level 36-40) of western Desolace drop them, and the totems do not bind, so the auction house is the other source. Gelkis kills add 20 each, but Forever's kill data stops them at the end of Friendly, 1 short of Honored. At Friendly the village has two craft orders for 1,000 each: Mirda's 3 Greater Shadow Protection Potions and Grolkar's 2 Massive Iron Axes (blacksmithing). Warug's A Conqueror's Crown (1,000) is no craft order: he wants a Conqueror's Helm from a crypt in the Badlands, and Forever's quest pages put it in his chain before the Valley of Bones, so bring it before you reach Honored. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10%.", zone = 1443, goals = {
