			steps = {
				{ title = "Bubulo Acerbus, the cloth quartermaster", tip = "Bubulo Acerbus takes cloth for the Gnomeregan Exiles; he stands in Tinker Town in Ironforge, by the tram. Each first donation of 60 Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth pays 150 reputation once; after the Runecloth one, Additional Runecloth pays 50 for every 20 Runecloth, as often as you like. The Auction House in the Commons is the quickest source of cloth. In Classic, quests pay full reputation while they are at most 5 levels below you, so do Dun Morogh (levels 1-12) and Gaxim Rustfizzle's quests in Stonetalon (20-25) while you level. After the donations come Laris Geardawdle's ooze quests and Overmaster Pyron (400), then the optional Dun Morogh hubs, best rate first: Coldridge Valley (about 38 a minute at full value), Kharanos (26), the quarry (17). Every Gnomeregan gain also gives a quarter as much to Stormwind, Ironforge and Darnassus, except quests in the level 1-10 start areas. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain.", zone = 1455, goals = {
