				{ title = "A Donation of Mageweave", tip = "Mageweave Cloth drops from humanoids level 35 to 50: the Shadowforge and Dark Iron dwarves of the Badlands and Searing Gorge, the Dunemaul ogres of Tanaris, the Hatecrest naga of Feralas.", zone = 1455, goals = {
