				{ title = "North of the Den", tip = "The cactus apples grow beside the cacti north of the Den. Hana'zua lies wounded by the rocks to the north; Sarkoth, his big scorpid, roams close by. Vile Familiars swarm at the mouth of the Burning Blade Coven; Thazz'ril's Pick lies inside: take the middle tunnel where it splits three ways.", when = { { label = "valley", test = "done" } }, zone = 1411, goals = {
