				{ title = "Around the Crossroads", tip = "The Razormane camps and the supply crates are north-east of the town; Chol'aruk, an elite boar, sits deep in the Thorn Hill cave there. The Witchwing harpies nest far to the north-west. The Beaten Corpse lies north-east of Camp Taurajo, in the south: right-click it. Raptors and plainstriders are everywhere.", when = { { label = "crossroads", test = "done" } }, zone = 1413, goals = {
