				{ title = "The Stockade: two quests", tip = "Optional: the Stockade is Stormwind's prison, a dungeon in the canals of the Mage Quarter. At 60 you clear it alone in ten minutes: 300 reputation. Warden Thelwater stands at the gate, Nikova Raskol in Old Town. Two more Stockade quests start outside the city, 100 each, if you pass by: What Comes Around... (Targorr the Dread) from Guard Berton in Lakeshire and Crime and Punishment (Dextren Ward) from Councilman Millstipe in Darkshire. (The Stockade Riots, 100 more, needs the Unsent Letter from Edwin VanCleef in the Deadmines first.) Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. Skip this step to skip the hub.", label = "sw-stockade", zone = 1429, goals = {
