				{ title = "The mine, the centaurs and the plains", tip = "Back to the mine for the workers, supervisors and Supervisor Fizsprocket in the back: his Mulgore Expansion Plans start Fizsprocket's Notes, and its other pages lie inside the mine. The Galak centaurs and Herak camp east of the village. Swoops fly all over Mulgore; the Windfury harpies roost south-east of the village; the Palemane gnolls camp west of it.", when = { { label = "bloodhoof", test = "done" } }, zone = 1456, goals = {
