				{ title = "Gloomrise (optional hub)", tip = "Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. The Earthen Ring camp on the Skywatcher Plateau, north-west of Thunder Bluff: 300 Thunder Bluff reputation in 20 minutes, plus 100 each for Orgrimmar and the Darkspear Trolls and 450 Earthen Ring. Muln Earthfury, Mazu'kon and Yorn Grimtotem stand in the camp.", label = "gloomrise", zone = 1412, goals = {
